==English==
[[File:Manta birostris-Thailand3.jpg|thumb|a '''manta ray''' ({{taxlink|Mobula birostris|species|ver=201103}}, syn. {{taxlink|Manta birostris|species|ver=170714}})]]

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|es|manta|t=blanket}}, after the blanket-shaped trap used to catch them.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|GenAm}} {{IPA|en|/ˈmæntəɹeɪ/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any of several very large [[pelagic]] [[ray]]s formerly of the genus ''[[Manta]]'', now placed in genus ''[[Mobula]]'', with winglike [[pectoral fin]]s, a long tail, and two fins resembling horns that project from the head.
#: {{syn|en|manta}}

